### 4. Pass Bar and Statistics
- **Primary unit**: Task ($n=90$). Union solve across seats ($L_{\text{arm}}$): solved if either `qwen32` or `r1d32` final code passes `agent.fresh_grade` at `FRESH_SEED = 104729`.
- **Primary contrast**: Arm G vs Arm C, paired over 90 tasks with net gain $\text{net} = L_G - L_C$.
- **Stage V partition**:
  - No-room rule: If $L_C \ge 77/90$ or $L_C \le 9/90$, verdict is `no_room`.
  - Keep: $\text{net} \ge 9$ (pinned $T_{\text{noise}} = 9$) AND exact one-sided sign test $p \le 0.05$.
  - Drop: $\text{net} \le 0$ OR $p > 0.10$.
  - Inconclusive: $0 < \text{net}$ AND $p \le 0.10$ AND NOT Keep.
- **Noise floor & Sensitivity**: $T=9$ is justified by the same-seed turn 0 design ($\sigma_{\text{paired}} = \sqrt{90/7} \approx 3.59$). Cross-seed noise on `v8` ($d2$ vs $d3$ discordance 7/30, $\sigma \approx 4.6$) defines sensitivity threshold $\text{net} \ge 12$, reported alongside the primary verdict.
- **Stage N triad placeholder**: Marked in the spec document awaiting completion of the running `crawdad-v8-d4` arm (seed base 4200).

